  "skills": {
    "basic": {
      "name": {
        "en": "Dokkaebi Bat"
      },
      "desc": {
        "en": "Gabi deals Physical DMG to enemies by swinging her Dokkaebi Bat wildly. She causes a shockwave on her finishing attack, dealing Earth DMG. / When she has 3 stacks of Spiritual Power, holding the Basic Attack button will trigger a Crushing Blow. Crushing Blows inflict Petrification and deal Earth DMG to nearby enemies. Enemies inflicted with Petrification take increased DMG from Crushing Blow. Gabi gains a DMG Reduction effect while Crushing Blow is active. / Using Crushing Blow during an enemy's special attack will momentarily neutralize the enemy. If an enemy is successfully neutralized while possessing Slugger's Will, the effect is immediately consumed and 3 stacks of Spiritual Power are gained. / Holding the Basic Attack button after using a Switch Skill triggers a Spinning Bat Attack, and Gabi will hurl the bat to attack enemies all around, dealing Physical DMG. / After using her Ultimate Skill, Gabi's Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing Earth DMG and increasing in Attack Speed each attack. (Max: 4 times)"
      },
